Alabama QSO Party in-state county, state and province multipliers
The class adds Alabama state credit when a county is worked, once per mode (issue 317).
AL is not a received exchange: Alabama stations must send their county.
The Al line below has a display name and NO alias, so it is on the multiplier list
but AL can never be received instead of a county.
DC and MDC count as Maryland. DXCC entities are the separate DX multiplier.
Only canonical state and province aliases: longer keys are host counties.

INCLUDE FILE alabama_cty.dom
Al = ^Alabama
Dc > Md = DC,MDC
Ar = AR,^Arkansas
Az = AZ,^Arizona
Ca = CA,^California
Co = CO,^Colorado
Ct = CT,^Connecticut
